1m/works/86\nhttps://skeb.jp/@tr91641m/works/79\nhttps://skeb.jp/@tr91641m/works/65\n\n\nギャラリー\nhttps://kallista.carrd.co/#sfw-reference", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/87", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 3469061, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b8f9869/uploads/origins/73dad59d-2c7b-41b0-ac0a-5c63e19c5642?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36a054695c629400748d5c0692d92592", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b8f9869/uploads/origins/73dad59d-2c7b-41b0-ac0a-5c63e19c5642?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6538479634076f606b3c268c10d1f2f9", "src_set": ""}, "body": "親切なアピールをありがとう。あなたの画風はとても美しく、スタイリッシュです！ぜひスパークルブルーを描いていただきたいです。\n髪型やコスチュームなど、何でも自由に変えてください。創作はすべてお任せします！\n\n彼女の参考文献：https://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1p06Mn3r1x0wMvM5RVES1s90Urodf6xwG\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1p06Mn3r1x0wMvM5RVES1s90Urodf6xwG", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/86", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 3404007, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88f2a213/uploads/origins/18513668-4091-4388-af46-42dc2d05e070?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6de9fe82948c31c031f034e092340f19", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88f2a213/uploads/origins/18513668-4091-4388-af46-42dc2d05e070?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6dd967f616f680b8c300ba3095e537c5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "前回のアートありがとうございました！今回は、バースデーケーキを持ち、パーティーハットをかぶったフェルミカイパのアートをお願いします。その他はお好みで。\n\nフェルミカイパ参考：https://imgur.com/a/pQC7Kr9\nパーティーハットとケーキ参考：https://imgur.com/a/UHvlxlV", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/85", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 1922788, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac2f643f/uploads/origins/d92e2ca5-e015-4456-9a9c-6724cd6d1e47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10543fb6e8c20f8e249b6adde65ec3cd", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac2f643f/uploads/origins/d92e2ca5-e015-4456-9a9c-6724cd6d1e47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81b00455ef02249470746d1e47ca57a6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのアピールを受け取り、あなたのアートスタイルが気に入りました！あなたのスタイルで私のキャラクターを見てみたいです！\n\n彼は星をテーマにした宇宙魔道士で、紫色のキラキラした長いポニーテールが特徴です。スタイリッシュな白いローブに黒と金の縁取り、金色のアクセサリーをつけたハンサムな青年です。魔法の光輪には星が描かれ、フェイスペイントには紫色の星があしらわれています。\n\nポーズは自由に選んでください！服装も自由に変更できます。\n\n\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1i_3EepFt0Kt7N1JR-6eJbToyw2-VJ_O4/view?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1i_3EepFt0Kt7N1JR-6eJbToyw2-VJ_O4/view?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/84", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 1248131, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3044d7a1/uploads/origins/72ebcbae-aa28-4ed3-85c4-b4d18896da58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4503a8e06ec54b1ad6468f167e748f74", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3044d7a1/uploads/origins/72ebcbae-aa28-4ed3-85c4-b4d18896da58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01c4ec9cc82069e68962f09063f3269a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "彼女はとてもストイックなので、参考資料の表情とほとんど変わりません。目は好きな時に黄色く光ることができ、アーチャーです。そのどれかをインスピレーションにして、好きなように描いてもらえれば嬉しいです。ご検討ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kGS6t6INIoSR4DB-jfNXUlKZMTzJNNAR?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/83", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 3093906, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58804e76/uploads/origins/79698367-1964-457f-a594-ccff3ebdac67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a20cf60e2d4c9794a043e8490fb8eba8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58804e76/uploads/origins/79698367-1964-457f-a594-ccff3ebdac67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f6ebb66cb9cd56b529b8da0b9daebc5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello!\n\nThank you for your Appeal! It made me very happy to hear you like my Super Hero Character! I really like your art style and illustrations and I was hoping to commission you for an illustration of my Vtuber Character!\n\nMy Vtuber is called Larity and she is a superhero who lives in space and has the power of gravity. Her personality is energetic and she has a fun sense of humour.\n\nI would love an illustration that focuses on her personality!\n\nHere is a folder full of reference pictures:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1thlP00uzlr7Y-MwnnQKTt7MxAfhJn_8C?usp=drive_link\n\nI would love to use your art as decoration for my VTuber schedule or YouTube thumbnail in the future and I will credit you if that is okay with you?\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/82", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 1498947, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5bc8807a/uploads/origins/b2043e3d-359d-43e6-ba2e-f814c7d27cac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8bfc9aae8b0f28cae4aa3f22983d5a20", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5bc8807a/uploads/origins/b2043e3d-359d-43e6-ba2e-f814c7d27cac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a0a966d4706fed81058f9ccea0d6de04", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！アピールありがとうございます！私のキャラクター、サイケンを楽しんで描いてください。彼はクールで自信家で、患者さんを診るのが好きな若い医者です。元気いっぱいの若手医師なので、できるだけ自信に満ち溢れた楽しそうな彼を描いてほしいです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cABeB39xBIQJwqyRTEFwb83iEsE-V0Qo?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/81", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 2458176, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/21ed80b3/uploads/origins/0be9c17e-e1e7-415e-968e-d559e4ceb419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6e514ca106e63f5519498d49620d55c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/21ed80b3/uploads/origins/0be9c17e-e1e7-415e-968e-d559e4ceb419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95d5dae236a4d8b30270b9c60c7389c9", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! Thank you for sending me your appeal. I would be honored for you to draw my vtuber persona. He is an arrogant, cocky medieval fantasy adventurer. He has a tsundere big brother personality even though he is sometimes a delinquent. He was originally my D&D character! \n\nI have included a link to his references for you. I will let you decide the pose and composition.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16qmauyRBBQpzdi8aOoiNbEMF7Cj0SZCx?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/80", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 3433827, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0339418c/uploads/origins/f77e1273-6706-46ee-98b8-35a95e55b4db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acafdec74153aee8d7b48a4adf69a21e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0339418c/uploads/origins/f77e1273-6706-46ee-98b8-35a95e55b4db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0017bb2971f1f93064a20766ca44e51e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。お返事が遅くなりましたが、アピールをありがとうございます。アピールをいただいたのは初めてです！\n\n私のキャラについてですが、URLに劣悪な参考画像があります。興味を持っていただきありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VCljKDd9xC3ecjZpeG10nJpTg0_kC9Hg?usp=share_link", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tr91641m/works/79", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2594252, "client_id": 2221550, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6a64f86/uploads/origins/62e94abd-cd6f-48c6-8250-1599e272adfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3af42d7860f3bd83